WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.735
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:09.736 --> 00:00:13.190
I'm a manta ray.

3
00:00:13.191 --> 00:00:18.394
We're the biggest rays on earth.

4
00:00:18.395 --> 00:00:21.558
Are you a fish?

5
00:00:21.559 --> 00:00:25.213
Yes, rays are fish.

6
00:00:25.214 --> 00:00:31.027
We have flat bodies and long tails.

7
00:00:31.028 --> 00:00:34.510
Where do you live?

8
00:00:34.511 --> 00:00:39.124
Manta rays live in the ocean.

9
00:00:39.125 --> 00:00:44.540
We like to swim in warm water.

10
00:00:44.541 --> 00:00:47.729
What do you eat?

11
00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:52.982
We eat very tiny fish and plants.

12
00:00:52.983 --> 00:00:56.746
They are called plankton.

13
00:00:56.747 --> 00:01:06.408
We swim with our mouths open to catch plankton.

14
00:01:06.409 --> 00:01:10.640
Do you have any enemies?

15
00:01:10.641 --> 00:01:15.445
Sharks and whales like to eat us.

16
00:01:15.446 --> 00:01:21.531
Sometimes we get stuck in people's fishing nets.

17
00:01:21.532 --> 00:01:25.231
Do you ever sting people?

18
00:01:25.232 --> 00:01:29.727
Many rays do sting people.

19
00:01:29.728 --> 00:01:33.423
But manta rays don't have stingers.

20
00:01:33.424 --> 00:01:38.516
We are usually calm and gentle around people.

21
00:01:38.517 --> 00:01:41.228
How do you swim?

22
00:01:41.229 --> 00:01:45.223
Our fins are like huge wings.

23
00:01:45.224 --> 00:01:54.438
We flap them to move through the water.

24
00:01:54.439 --> 00:02:00.610
We can even dive and do loops.

25
00:02:00.611 --> 00:02:07.756
I see some plankton. Watch this!

26
00:02:07.757 --> 00:02:13.738
Good-bye, Manta Ray!

